'''Greece''' is the 23rd stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. [[Sir Seal]] is introduced here. Upon completion in Chapter 1, [[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Bean Cats]] and the [[Gamatoto Expedition]] feature will be unlocked. Upon completion in Chapter 2, [[Skirt Cat (Special Cat)|Skirt Cat]] will be available to purchase for [[Cat Food]].

