==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~4 seconds<sup>30f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 95% HP:
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 93% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Start by spamming [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cats]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]] to stall the enemies. Try to last long enough to get a full wallet and a level 8 [[Worker Cat]]. When Sir Seal comes, let him progress towards your base, then focus on spamming Fish Cats alongside meatshields and Axe Cats. Stack [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]] for extra support.

Do not use [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] - Sir Seal will continuously knock him back before he can attack even once.

