==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Shiga Prefecture'''.
*Shiga Prefecture's base is a [https://youtu.be/gRC6pp3Pa8w Shigaraki yaki tanuki] wearing the helmet of [https://hikone-hikonyan.jp/ Hikonyan], a mascot made to commemorate the 400th anniversary of the founding of [[wikipedia:Hikone Castle|Hikone Castle]] in Shiga.

